invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_cfg.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: the SPKI pin rule admits one pin over CH_SPKI_PIN_MAX, the cap
  docs/webpki.md states. The first-invalid count row objects.

--- old
    return cfg->spki_pin_count > 0 && cfg->spki_pin_count <= CH_SPKI_PIN_MAX;
--- new
    return cfg->spki_pin_count > 0 && cfg->spki_pin_count <= CH_SPKI_PIN_MAX + 1;
